{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Where is My Son?",
    "steam_appid": 2403550,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/86675816449d068b794c7d4c0c0db846.avif?t=1755037537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deeply grieved by his wife's death, Chris is completely devastated when his son also disappears without a trace.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His search for his son Cedric quickly turns into a surreal adventure filled with shadows, secrets, and supernatural forces. Strange symbols, forgotten places, and unexplained events begin to surface, dragging Chris into a world where logic breaks down and nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why did Cedric disappear? What is the great secret behind his disappearance?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This dramatic journey, where love, time, darkness, and light coexist, will uncover all the hidden and unknown truths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore towns, forests, hospitals, caves, houses, mazes, underground shelters, hidden areas, restaurants, shops, and many other locations\u2014interact with people to uncover clues and progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/194e04a56f0d050c86196e4b5ec081d3.avif?t=1755037537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While exploring caves, you might have to fight a bear or break through rocks to move forward!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/eaeafdf9df865798909ed6669c6cc2d5.poster.avif?t=1755037537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/eaeafdf9df865798909ed6669c6cc2d5.webm?t=1755037537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/eaeafdf9df865798909ed6669c6cc2d5.mp4?t=1755037537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be prepared for all kinds of challenges on your journey to find Cedric.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/6e2da2c611c00723fbb24ad758ca3860.poster.avif?t=1755037537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/6e2da2c611c00723fbb24ad758ca3860.webm?t=1755037537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/6e2da2c611c00723fbb24ad758ca3860.mp4?t=1755037537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sometimes, you may even need to bring a fish to a restaurant owner just to get a clue!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/0b542d6651039580ac3c6cc54ed0ab73.avif?t=1755037537\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini-Games</strong><br>You can trigger some very interesting scenes by interacting with certain objects!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, you\u2019ll need to play a console game or connect electrical wires to progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/f2aa47121b6ae91e556468b88a8b44f9.poster.avif?t=1755037537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/f2aa47121b6ae91e556468b88a8b44f9.webm?t=1755037537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/f2aa47121b6ae91e556468b88a8b44f9.mp4?t=1755037537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that's not all\u2014many more surprise mini-games are waiting for you throughout the narrative!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/abf927750f9a53eee77461ad94190cfd.poster.avif?t=1755037537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/abf927750f9a53eee77461ad94190cfd.webm?t=1755037537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/abf927750f9a53eee77461ad94190cfd.mp4?t=1755037537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dramatic and surprising story...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Chris searches for his son Cedric, the past and future will intertwine in unexpected ways, leading to emotional and heartfelt moments throughout the journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/194e04a56f0d050c86196e4b5ec081d3.avif?t=1755037537\" /></span><strong>Message from the game developer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character cards, the option to play in 11 languages, mazes, puzzles, and many more features I can't even begin to describe are waiting for you in this adventure. You might even have to build something sometimes!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game for me; it is life itself. All our sorrows, joys, dreams\u2026 In short, all the emotions we experience are brought to life within this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am Deniz Yukar\u0131\u00e7ukur, the creator of this game. I am also a father\u2014the father of a 3-year-old daughter\u2014and I am married. I tried to reflect everything I\u2019ve felt in real life into this game as much as I could.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, I also included things we\u2019ve always wondered about but never had the chance to experience in real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you enjoy this game. I\u2019d be very happy if you add it to your wishlist to help this small but sincere community grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/9c5cc65d73b76eeda1a468f1a07aac2a.avif?t=1755037537\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/86675816449d068b794c7d4c0c0db846.avif?t=1755037537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deeply grieved by his wife's death, Chris is completely devastated when his son also disappears without a trace.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His search for his son Cedric quickly turns into a surreal adventure filled with shadows, secrets, and supernatural forces. Strange symbols, forgotten places, and unexplained events begin to surface, dragging Chris into a world where logic breaks down and nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why did Cedric disappear? What is the great secret behind his disappearance?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This dramatic journey, where love, time, darkness, and light coexist, will uncover all the hidden and unknown truths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore towns, forests, hospitals, caves, houses, mazes, underground shelters, hidden areas, restaurants, shops, and many other locations\u2014interact with people to uncover clues and progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/194e04a56f0d050c86196e4b5ec081d3.avif?t=1755037537\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While exploring caves, you might have to fight a bear or break through rocks to move forward!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/eaeafdf9df865798909ed6669c6cc2d5.poster.avif?t=1755037537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/eaeafdf9df865798909ed6669c6cc2d5.webm?t=1755037537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/eaeafdf9df865798909ed6669c6cc2d5.mp4?t=1755037537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be prepared for all kinds of challenges on your journey to find Cedric.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/6e2da2c611c00723fbb24ad758ca3860.poster.avif?t=1755037537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/6e2da2c611c00723fbb24ad758ca3860.webm?t=1755037537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/6e2da2c611c00723fbb24ad758ca3860.mp4?t=1755037537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sometimes, you may even need to bring a fish to a restaurant owner just to get a clue!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/0b542d6651039580ac3c6cc54ed0ab73.avif?t=1755037537\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini-Games</strong><br>You can trigger some very interesting scenes by interacting with certain objects!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, you\u2019ll need to play a console game or connect electrical wires to progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/f2aa47121b6ae91e556468b88a8b44f9.poster.avif?t=1755037537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/f2aa47121b6ae91e556468b88a8b44f9.webm?t=1755037537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/f2aa47121b6ae91e556468b88a8b44f9.mp4?t=1755037537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that's not all\u2014many more surprise mini-games are waiting for you throughout the narrative!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/abf927750f9a53eee77461ad94190cfd.poster.avif?t=1755037537\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/abf927750f9a53eee77461ad94190cfd.webm?t=1755037537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/abf927750f9a53eee77461ad94190cfd.mp4?t=1755037537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dramatic and surprising story...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Chris searches for his son Cedric, the past and future will intertwine in unexpected ways, leading to emotional and heartfelt moments throughout the journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/194e04a56f0d050c86196e4b5ec081d3.avif?t=1755037537\" /></span><strong>Message from the game developer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character cards, the option to play in 11 languages, mazes, puzzles, and many more features I can't even begin to describe are waiting for you in this adventure. You might even have to build something sometimes!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game for me; it is life itself. All our sorrows, joys, dreams\u2026 In short, all the emotions we experience are brought to life within this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am Deniz Yukar\u0131\u00e7ukur, the creator of this game. I am also a father\u2014the father of a 3-year-old daughter\u2014and I am married. I tried to reflect everything I\u2019ve felt in real life into this game as much as I could.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, I also included things we\u2019ve always wondered about but never had the chance to experience in real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you enjoy this game. I\u2019d be very happy if you add it to your wishlist to help this small but sincere community grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403550/extras/9c5cc65d73b76eeda1a468f1a07aac2a.avif?t=1755037537\" /></span></p>",
